                        <div class="lp-body">
                            <div class="lp-label">Required Patient Portal</div>
                            <div class="lp-desc">Yes: OPD registration / booking and B2C lab booking create the patient's Patient Portal login and send the Patient ID and password by e-mail and WhatsApp (once per patient, when the patient has a mobile number or an e-mail). No: no automatic logins; staff can still send one from Patient Master. B2B bookings are never affected.</div>
